# Single, narrow exception: the root Dockerfile's `runpod-lb` target (and
# .modal/Dockerfile) bake this specific model
# into the image deliberately (avoids a runtime download polluting the cold-start
# measurement this deployment exists to produce -- see serverless/runpod/README.md).
